  "body": "Secure your place in one of Milford's most sought-after locations with this modern three-bedroom unit,perfectly positioned in the coveted Double Westlake school zones.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, investor, downsizer or family focused on education, you'll love theconvenience of low-maintenance living just minutes from Milford Beach, local shops, cafés and transportlinks.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* Double Westlake Boys' & Girls' High School zones\r\n* Three bedrooms\r\n* Modern kitchen with quality appliances \r\n* Open-plan living and dining\r\n* Sunny outdoor living area\r\n* Milford School & Takapuna Normal Intermediate zones\r\n* Easy-care, lock-up-and-leave lifestyle\r\n* Close to Milford Beach, shopping and cafes\r\n* 2 YEARS BODY CORP CASHBACK ON SETTLEMENT\r\n\r\nVendor to provide a cashback contribution on settlement equivalent to two years of Body Corporate fees.\r\n\r\nAffordable Milford buying. Premium school zones. Exceptional value.",
